        "steam_appid": 3886120,
        "required_age": 0,
        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886120/extras/e0b8ef2e741ea33fa59bca0681757575.poster.avif?t=1765222908\" width=780 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886120/extras/e0b8ef2e741ea33fa59bca0681757575.webm?t=1765222908\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mate with an alien queen, or kill her. Become a cosmic entity, talk to a stone to discover the secrets of the universe, become a space pirate or a parasite-infected horror. The choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You drift through cold, unforgiving space, stranded far from Earth and desperate to return home. Strange worlds lie before you, each ripe with secrets and cosmic dread. Mystery haunts every alien landscape and forgotten starship, where even the silence feels alive and foreboding. Driven by the hope of reuniting with your daughter back home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886120/extras/45b25c97134c38912ebd3500775cbf89.poster.avif?t=1765222908\" width=780 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886120/extras/45b25c97134c38912ebd3500775cbf89.webm?t=1765222908\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Robust RPG mechanics: level-up progression, turn-based combat, inventory management, bartering, skill checks, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A soundtrack 100% made by humans</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Hand-crafted illustrations (also completely human-made)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Rich story packed with smart or absurd choices that will get you killed in interesting ways (last time I checked, AI couldn't crack a joke).</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886120/extras/e0b8ef2e741ea33fa59bca0681757575.poster.avif?t=1765222908\" width=780 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886120/extras/e0b8ef2e741ea33fa59bca0681757575.webm?t=1765222908\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mate with an alien queen, or kill her. Become a cosmic entity, talk to a stone to discover the secrets of the universe, become a space pirate or a parasite-infected horror. The choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You drift through cold, unforgiving space, stranded far from Earth and desperate to return home. Strange worlds lie before you, each ripe with secrets and cosmic dread. Mystery haunts every alien landscape and forgotten starship, where even the silence feels alive and foreboding. Driven by the hope of reuniting with your daughter back home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886120/extras/45b25c97134c38912ebd3500775cbf89.poster.avif?t=1765222908\" width=780 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3886120/extras/45b25c97134c38912ebd3500775cbf89.webm?t=1765222908\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Robust RPG mechanics: level-up progression, turn-based combat, inventory management, bartering, skill checks, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A soundtrack 100% made by humans</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Hand-crafted illustrations (also completely human-made)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Rich story packed with smart or absurd choices that will get you killed in interesting ways (last time I checked, AI couldn't crack a joke).</p>",
        "short_description": "A choice-driven narrative game with RPG mechanics, filled with cosmic wonders and horror. Forge your own path across more than 50 unique endings. Barter, upgrade your character, fight, and explore alien worlds, overcoming every obstacle to find your way back to Earth… and to your daughter.",
